<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Fosters' extends Ballarat offer.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Fosters' extends Ballarat offer.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foster's Brewing Group Ltd extended its hostile A$2.50-per-share offer for tourism and leisure firm The Ballarat Brewing Co Ltd until February 7, as acceptances barely trickle in.</p>
<p>Foster's unit, Carlton and United Breweries Ltd (CUB), has garnered less than one percent of the stock since making its cash bid and is now entitled to 42.39 percent, according to documents released on Thursday by CUB.</p>
<p>&quot;When the first of the offers were made CUB was entitled to 41.68 percent of Ballarat Brewing's ordinary shares,&quot; CUB said.</p>
<p>-- Melbourne newsroom 613-9286-1421</p>
</text>
